NAME
    view - Display a text file in the console.

SYNOPSIS
    view <file>

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Displays a text file. A relative file name is opened from the current working directory.
    A path may also be supplied directly. Quoted paths are accepted.

EXAMPLES
    view README.TXT
    view Docs/NOTES.TXT
    view "/User/Dave/My Notes.txt"

FILES
    /System/Commands/VIEW.CMD
    /INU/HELP/VIEW.MAN
